<title>USA: Advanta Q4 charge-off rate rises.</title>
<headline>Advanta Q4 charge-off rate rises.</headline>
<dateline>SPRING HOUSE, Pa. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanta Corp said Tuesday its consolidated managed charge-off rate increased to 3.9 percent in fourth quarter 1996, up from 2.3 percent for same quarter 1995 and the 3.2 percent posted in the third quarter.</p>
<p>The charge-off rate on managed credit cards was 4.6 percent for the fourth quarter 1996, compared with 2.6 percent in 1995 and the 3.7 percent recorded in the third quarter.</p>
</text>
